text = "
[center]Choose an animation by typing a term in the searchbar,
or by selecting one from the index page. 

Once a term has been selected, a fullscreen button will appear, select it to access more features.

Navigate the camera in fullscreen using the arrow keys.
Press the + and - keys to zoom in and out. 
Select the home key to return to the default position. 

The camera can also be moved with the mouse. 

Click and hold the left mouse button while scrolling left or right to rotate horizontally. 
Click and hold the left mouse button while scrolling up or down to move vertically. 
Use the mouse wheel to zoom in and out. 
Click the right mouse button to return to the default position. 

Left click and drag on the video bar below the animation to move the animation forward or backwards. 

Hit ESC at anytime to close the program.
"
autowrap_mode = 2

